            <p class="">Our Toner Pads use a stabilized Vitamin C derivative (3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid) - not pure ascorbic acid, which degrades quickly and can irritate skin. This advanced form converts to active Vitamin C once absorbed, delivering the same powerful antioxidant benefits without instability or stinging. It neutralizes free radicals from UV exposure and pollution, stimulates collagen production, and brightens dull, uneven skin over time. The stabilized form also means the product stays effective from the first pad to the last - no oxidation, no loss of potency. It's clinical-grade protection that works with your skin, not against it.</p>
