            <p class="">Not all Hyaluronic Acid is created equal. Most products use a single molecular weight, which only hydrates at one depth. Our Toner Pads use a multi-weight Hyaluronic Acid complex - combining high, medium, and low molecular weights - so moisture is delivered and locked in at every layer of the skin. The larger molecules form a hydrating barrier on the surface, while the smaller molecules penetrate deeper to plump from within. The result is hydration that lasts all day, not just the first hour. Well-hydrated skin also absorbs other actives more effectively, which means every ingredient in the formula works harder.</p>
