          <div class="faq-column faq-column--right">
            
              
            
              
            
              
            
              
            
              
            
              
            
              
            
              
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <p>How long does one jar last?</p>
                    <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewbox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
<path d="M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z" fill="#006E37" stroke="#006E37" stroke-width="0.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p></p><p>Each jar contains 50ml of product. We recommend using consistently for 2-3 months to experience the full cellular renewal and anti-aging benefits.</p>
<p></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              
            
              
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <p>Is this best used with Renewal &amp; Rejuvenation Toner Pads?</p>
                    <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewbox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
<path d="M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z" fill="#006E37" stroke="#006E37" stroke-width="0.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p></p><p>Absolutely — they're designed to work as a complete system. The <a href="/products/renewal-rejuvenation-toner-pads?variant=44328294809679&amp;selling_plan=1699348559" title="/products/renewal-rejuvenation-toner-pads?variant=44328294809679&amp;selling_plan=1699348559">Toner Pads</a> prep your skin first by gently exfoliating dead cells and delivering treatment actives like Peptides, Snail Mucin, and Alpha-Arbutin deep into clean skin. This primes your skin to absorb everything that comes next. The Anti-Aging Moisturizer then locks it all in with NAD+ cellular repair technology, Ceramides, and a 5-Layer Hyaluronic Acid complex that seals moisture and strengthens your skin barrier. Together, the Toner Pads treat and the Moisturizer protects — so you're getting brightening, firming, dark spot correction, and deep hydration working in layers, not competing on the surface. Customers who use both report faster, more visible results. Save $26 when you buy them together as a bundle.</p>
<p></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              
            
              
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <p>Where on the body can it be used?</p>
                    <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewbox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
<path d="M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z" fill="#006E37" stroke="#006E37" stroke-width="0.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p></p><p>Everywhere your skin needs a little extra love. It's perfect for your face and neck as a daily moisturizer, but don't stop there — apply it to your décolleté, chest, shoulders, and hands for the same firming, hydrating, and brightening benefits. These areas show signs of aging just as quickly as your face, and the NAD+ cellular technology and 5-layer Hyaluronic Acid work just as effectively anywhere you use it. Think of it as a full anti-aging treatment, not just a face cream.</p>
<p></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              
            
              
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <p>Do you test on animals?</p>
                    <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewbox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
<path d="M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z" fill="#006E37" stroke="#006E37" stroke-width="0.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p></p><p>Never have, never will. JIYU is 100% cruelty-free. None of our products or ingredients are tested on animals at any stage of development. Our formulas are developed and manufactured in Korea using advanced clinical testing methods — real science, zero animal testing.</p>
<p></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              
            
              
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <p>Does JIYU&nbsp;use safe, clean ingredients?</p>
                    <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewbox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
<path d="M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z" fill="#006E37" stroke="#006E37" stroke-width="0.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p></p><p>Our formula is crafted with what your skin <em>needs</em> — and nothing it doesn't. JIYU Toner Pads are free from:</p><p>✗ Sulfates (SLS/SLES) ✗ Parabens ✗ Silicones ✗ Mineral Oil ✗ Synthetic Fragrances ✗ Phthalates ✗ Formaldehyde &amp; Formaldehyde Releasers ✗ Hydroquinone ✗ Retinol / Retinoids ✗ Drying Alcohols ✗ Artificial Dyes &amp; Colorants</p><p>Every ingredient is intentional. We use clean, science-backed Korean actives — no fillers, no harsh chemicals, no shortcuts. Just 9 clinically supported ingredients designed to deliver real, visible results while being gentle enough for sensitive skin.</p>
<p></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              
            
              
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <p>What age is the moisturizing cream best for?</p>
                    <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewbox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
<path d="M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z" fill="#006E37" stroke="#006E37" stroke-width="0.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p></p><p>JiYu's NAD+ Cream is designed to meet your skin wherever it is. In your 20s and 30s, the Niacinamide and Vitamin C duo brightens dull skin, fades early dark spots, and builds antioxidant protection before damage sets in. In your 40s and 50s, NAD+ cellular technology kicks into high gear — recharging skin cells, boosting collagen from within, and reversing the visible effects of stress, late nights, and hormonal shifts. For 60+, the Ceramide and Shea Butter complex deeply nourishes thinning skin while the 5-layer Hyaluronic Acid restores plumpness and comfort that mature skin craves. Every age gets a different benefit from the same powerhouse jar — that's what a clinical-grade active complex is built to do.</p>
<p></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              
            
          </div>

        

